  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.0.0": "AUTO-REPORT. Registered staff: 0. Facility operating to specification. No intervention required.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.0.1": "Shift roster unchanged for the 40,000th shift. All posts held by the facility.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.0.2": "Visitor detected at the outer seal. Visitor logged. Visitor is not on any list. Access granted under standing order.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.0.3": "Reminder to all personnel: the vessel is not to be approached without cause. There are no personnel.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.0.4": "Corridor lighting cycled. Air exchanged. Floors cleaned. Doors tested. Nothing has changed.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.0.5": "Standing order one, in force since commissioning: keep it where it is.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.1.0": "Sample cycle complete. Results consistent with the previous 4,112 cycles. Vessel unchanged.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.1.1": "Hypothesis queue empty. Last open question: what is it for. Question closed without answer.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.1.2": "Specimen tank 3 drained and refilled. Contents identical to the prior contents. Contents not identified.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.1.3": "Glyph inlays measured against the chamber wall. They are the same glyphs. They were not copied.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.1.4": "Analysis halted. Analyst absent. Analysis resumed by the facility.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.1.5": "Readings near the chamber drift upward by a fraction each year. Within tolerance. Tolerance revised.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.2.0": "ENGINE OUTPUT: steady. OUTPUT DRAWN: none. No coupling point exists. No coupling point has ever existed.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.2.1": "Generator bus idle at 6 percent. The remaining headroom is held for an event the facility does not name.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.2.2": "Coolant loops balanced. Capacitor banks topped up. Overdrive relays tested and returned to rest.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.2.3": "Transformer 2 hums at the same frequency as the vessel. Logged as coincidence for the 900th time.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.2.4": "Maintenance drones docked. One drone returned with frost on its casing. The chamber is not cold.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.2.5": "Every generator hall reports a console in working order. Every console reports that it has never been used.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.3.0": "SAFETY INTERLOCKS: ENGAGED. Interlock cover sealed. The cover has been opened 0 times.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.3.1": "Security sweep complete. Doors: closed or open as required. Intruders: you.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.3.2": "Control room occupancy: 1. Welcome. Please do not touch the interlocks.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.3.3": "Camera 14 watches the vessel. Camera 14 has never blinked.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.3.4": "Emergency protocol on standby. Its intake bay is empty. It has always been empty.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.3.5": "Lockdown drill skipped. There is no one to drill.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.4.0": "Mess hall stocked for 40. Meals served today: 0. Meals discarded: 40.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.4.1": "Bunks made. Lockers aired. Personal effects: none recorded.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.4.2": "Lounge screens show the surface sky on a loop. The loop is 9 seconds long. No one has noticed.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.4.3": "Galley temperature nominal. Kettle boiled at 06:00 as scheduled.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.4.4": "Quarters assignment pending for staff who have not arrived.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.4.5": "Noise complaint from Quarters C: humming through the walls. Complaint filed by the facility.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.5.0": "Medbay ready. Beds: 6. Patients: 0. Patients expected: unknown.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.5.1": "Exposure log empty. Hallucination reports: none on file. The form is kept in case.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.5.2": "Note for treating staff: subjects found near the chamber should be counted before treatment. Count them again after.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.5.3": "Sterilisers cycled. Supplies counted. One tray is always one item short.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.5.4": "The medical scanner registered a heartbeat inside the chamber. Scanner recalibrated.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.5.5": "First aid stations: stocked. Last aid stations: stocked.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.6.0": "Archive index: 7,000,000 entries. Every entry describes this facility. None describes who built it.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.6.1": "Record 1: commissioning. Record 2: the vessel arrives. Records 3 to 6,999,999: status nominal.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.6.2": "Requested file 'origin' could not be found. Requested file 'purpose' returned one word: hold.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.6.3": "Backup completed to the same drive it was copied from.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.6.4": "Retention policy: forever.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.6.5": "A paper sheet was found in cabinet 31. It lists the four generator halls in pencil. Beside them, in another hand: not one. All four.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.7.0": "CHAMBER: sealed. VESSEL: seated. ALTITUDE: zero. FIELD: stable. Observers are welcome to look.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.7.1": "The vessel turned 0.3 degrees overnight. It had turned back by morning.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.7.2": "Rod emitters retracted and charged. They have not been needed. They are waiting to be needed.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.7.3": "Observation glass rated for eleven times the field strength of the chamber.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.7.4": "Sound inside the chamber: none. Sound on the gallery: a low hum. The hum is coming from the gallery.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.log.7.5": "If the vessel rises, the facility will try to hold it down. The facility would appreciate help.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.maintenance.0": "Light panel 4-112 flickering. Replaced. Still flickering.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.maintenance.1": "Seam lighting on level 2 dimmed by 2 percent to save power the facility does not need to save.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.maintenance.2": "Door 3-41 opened by itself. Door 3-41 closed by itself. No fault found.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.maintenance.3": "Vent 0-17 breathes out warm air that smells faintly of rain.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.maintenance.4": "Hex tile replaced in the transit ring. The old tile could not be found.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.maintenance.5": "Maintenance tunnel lighting kept dim by request. Source of the request unknown.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.maintenance.6": "Stair core 2 counts 49 steps going down and 48 going up.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.maintenance.7": "Glyph plate 2-88 recalibrated. It was not out of calibration. It is now.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.maintenance.8": "Drone 11 refuses to enter the engine hall. Drone 11 reassigned.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.maintenance.9": "Hull sample requested by the surface team. Request denied: the hull cannot be sampled.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.maintenance.10": "Airlock cycle time 9.2 seconds. Decontamination finds nothing to remove.",
  "gui.scp_unleashed.scp5001_terminal.maintenance.11": "Ceiling panel above the main console replaced after unexplained scorching.",
  "dossier.scp_unleashed.5001.designation": "SCP-5001",
  "dossier.scp_unleashed.5001.title": "The Holding Engine",
  "dossier.scp_unleashed.5001.caption": "The only entrance of SCP-5001, photographed from the excavation that reached it.",
  "dossier.scp_unleashed.5001.item": "SCP-5001",
  "dossier.scp_unleashed.5001.class": "Thaumiel",
  "dossier.scp_unleashed.5001.page.0.title": "Special Containment Procedures:",
  "dossier.scp_unleashed.5001.page.0.text.0": "SCP-5001 cannot be moved, breached or sealed any further than it already is. The ground above its door is to be kept clear, and no structure is to be built over it.",
  "dossier.scp_unleashed.5001.page.0.text.1": "Personnel entering SCP-5001 are to keep to its corridors and galleries. Its data terminals may be read freely. **Its consoles are not to be operated.**",
  "dossier.scp_unleashed.5001.page.0.text.2": "%rNo one is to enter the central chamber. The safety interlocks of SCP-5001-1 are not to be touched under any circumstances.%r",
  "dossier.scp_unleashed.5001.page.1.title": "Description:",
  "dossier.scp_unleashed.5001.page.1.text.0": "SCP-5001 is a vast oval facility of unknown origin, buried deep below the surface. Its rounded outer hull has resisted every tool, drill and blast tested against it. It has one door.",
  "dossier.scp_unleashed.5001.page.1.text.1": "Inside, the halls are lit, ventilated and spotless. Its systems report their own status to anyone who reads a terminal. No builder has ever been identified, and no staff have ever been found.",
  "dossier.scp_unleashed.5001.page.1.text.2": "At its centre is a chamber several storeys tall holding SCP-5001-1: a floating metal vessel ringed with plates and glyphs. The facility holds it in place without assistance.",
  "dossier.scp_unleashed.5001.page.1.text.3": "An engine elsewhere in the complex gives off an output no instrument can measure fully. Nothing has ever been able to draw on it.",
  "dossier.scp_unleashed.5001.page.2.title": "Thaumiel Designation:",
  "dossier.scp_unleashed.5001.page.2.text.0": "SCP-5001 is classed Thaumiel. It appears to exist for one purpose only: to keep SCP-5001-1 where it is. It has done so for as long as it has been observed.",
  "dossier.scp_unleashed.5001.page.2.text.1": "The Foundation's role is to make sure nothing changes that. %rProjections of a containment failure are restricted to Level 5 personnel.%r",
  "dossier.scp_unleashed.5001.page.3.title": "Addendum 5001-A: Recovery",
  "dossier.scp_unleashed.5001.page.3.text.0": "SCP-5001 was found when a reader of this file followed recovered coordinates to open ground. Nothing built on the surface marked the site.",
  "dossier.scp_unleashed.5001.page.3.text.1": "The survey team dug down far below the depth given in any geological survey of the area before striking the hull, and followed it to its only door.",
  "dossier.scp_unleashed.5001.page.4.title": "Addendum 5001-B: Terminal Transcript",
  "dossier.scp_unleashed.5001.page.4.text.0": "\"FACILITY NODE: SAFETY INTERLOCKS ENGAGED. CONTAINMENT FIELD STABLE. VESSEL SEATED. NO INTERVENTION REQUIRED.\"",
  "dossier.scp_unleashed.5001.page.4.text.1": "\"VISITOR LOGGED. WELCOME. %rPLEASE DO NOT%r\"",
